UI.Nation.PerCapitaGDPHelp2=The Economy and Spoils priorities each increase Per Capita GDP by ${0} per {1}.
UI.Nation.GDPHelp1=A nation's GDP, or Gross Domestic Product, is a measure of its annual economic output in U.S. dollars adjusted by purchasing power parity. The nation's GDP determines how many Control Points a nation has, how many Investment Points it produces, and how difficult certain missions there are. GDP increases from both the Economy and Spoils priorities are included in the 31-day GDP change above.
